WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.590
Now that you've built Cat Clicker,

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:04.745
I want you to reflect on a few things.

00:00:04.745 --> 00:00:08.005
Let me know in the boxes below how hard was this for you,

00:00:08.005 --> 00:00:09.725
and how do you feel about your code,

00:00:09.725 --> 00:00:12.600
and how many times did you click your cat?

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.090
There are no right or wrong answers for this quiz.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:19.145
Mainly, I just would like you to reflect on your experience so far.

00:00:19.145 --> 00:00:21.024
After you share your reflections,

00:00:21.024 --> 00:00:23.960
we'll talk to Andy and see how he's doing.

